2026-07-27T10:02:35.6952955Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:02:35.6953809Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:02:35.6954910Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
